s you to know about it","source":"https://www.eastidahonews.com/2023/02/an-abuse-of-the-us-constitution-brought-him-to-eastern-idaho-why-his-son-wants-you-to-know-about-it/","author":["[[Rett Nelson]]"],"published":"2023-02-24","created":"2026-07-22","description":"IDAHO FALLS – Jon Ochi, a 75-year-old Idaho Falls man of Japanese descent, is standing in his old sign shop at 275 Chamberlain Avenue as he looks through old photos and newspaper clippings dating back more than 80 years ago. The images contain a record of what Ochi describes as a hostile, and largely forgotten, […]","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},